# Imodane's Recruiter ({2}{R}, 2/2): "When this creature enters, creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn."
# Turn 1: Train Troops (two Knights). Turn 3: Bot1 casts the Recruiter from exile (CR 715.3d) with three Moxen. Its trigger
# affects the creatures Bot1 controls as it resolves: both Knights and the Recruiter itself become 3/2 with haste, so the
# Recruiter (just cast) and a Knight attack for 6. Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) is not affected (a Memnite Bot1 casts afterwards is
# not either: the effect has already locked in its creatures, CR 611.2c, and the new 1/1 stays summoning-sick and can't attack).
# At turn 4 the pump has ended and the Recruiter is a 2/2 again (CR 514.2).

